groups shows the three flag group rules.

login needs its two flags together, emit needs exactly one of its two,
and push ties a local flag to a persistent one.

Usage:
  groups [command]

Available Commands:
  completion  Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
  emit        Write the report in one format
  help        Help about any command
  login       Log in with a user and a password
  push        Push the work to a remote

Flags:
  -h, --help      help for groups
      --version   version for groups

Use "groups [command] --help" for more information about a command.
